{"sourceUrl":"https://yyxy.njau.edu.cn/info/1193/16360.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:55.543389+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://yyxy.njau.edu.cn/info/1193/16360.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>为搭建全国高校园艺类相关专业优秀大学生交流平台，选拔学生继续从事园艺领域前沿研究，南京农业大学园艺学院将举办</span></span><span>202</span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年全国优秀大学生夏令营，具体通知如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>一、时间地点</span></span></p>\n<p><span>202</span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span>7</span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span>-</span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>日，线下进行，具体日程安排另行通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>二、报名条件</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1.</span><span><span>国内本科批次及以上院校全日制在读</span></span><span>202</span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>级本科生，具有园艺、农学、生物技术、植物保护等相关学科背景（不限于）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2.</span><span><span>具有良好的思想品德和政治素养，在校期间未受过任何纪律处分，身心健康；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3.</span><span><span>学习成绩优秀，在校期间总成绩专业排名前</span></span><span>1/3</span><span><span>，在科研工作或各类学科竞赛中有突出成绩者优先（如已在重要学术期刊上发表论文、获得省级以上竞赛奖项）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4.</span><span><span>英语成绩优秀，英语四级</span></span><span>460</span><span><span>分以上或英语六级</span></span><span>425</span><span><span>分以上或具有其他同等英语水平证明。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>三、报名方式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>有意报名的同学</span></span><span><span>①</span></span><span><span>于</span></span><span>202</span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>26</span></span><span><span>日前将报名材料电子版压缩文件发送至学院指定邮箱（</span>1612027002@qq.com），</span><span><span>②扫描下方微信小程序</span></span><span><span>进行报名，并申请加入夏令营</span></span><span>QQ</span><span><span>群</span></span><span><span>（</span><span>996855705），</span></span><span><span>加群备注</span></span><span><span>夏令营</span><span>+</span></span><span><span>学校</span><span>+姓名</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（注意：邮件名称以</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>姓名</span></span><span>-</span><span><span>学校名称</span></span><span>-</span><span><span>报名材料</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>命名，邮件中电子压缩包文件名称以</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>姓名</span></span><span>-</span><span><span>学校名称</span></span><span>-</span><span><span>专业</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>命名。）</span></span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://yyxy.njau.edu.cn/__local/1/38/FC/82EF1E5255C2432388D65644D57_83AACEFC_CF93.jpg\"/></p>\n<p><strong><span>1.</span></strong><strong><span><span>报名提交材料清单：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>）</span></span><span>202</span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年夏令营报名表</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>份（附件</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span>2</span><span><span>）本科阶段成绩单扫描件</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>份（需教务部门盖章扫描成</span></span><span>PDF</span><span><span>文件）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span>3</span><span><span>）英语水平证明材料扫描件</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>份；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span>4</span><span><span>）个人自荐陈述（格式不限）</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>份；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span>5</span><span><span>）其他证明材料扫描件（如已发表录用论文、各类获奖或资格证书）各</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>份；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span>6</span><span><span>）个人安全责任协议书</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>份（附件</span></span><span>2</span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>报到当天</span></span><span><span>提交）。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>2.</span></strong><strong><span><span>联系方式：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>联</span></span> <span><span>系</span></span> <span><span>人：</span></span><span><span>鲁</span></span><span><span>老师</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系电话：</span></span><span>025-84395022</span></p>\n<p><span><span>地址：江苏省南京市</span></span><span><span>江北新区滨江大道</span><span>666号</span></span><span><span>，南京农业大学园艺学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>邮编：</span></span><span>21</span><span><span>1800</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>四、审核办法</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>报名材料审核与录取工作将在</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>日前结束，录取名单及活动安排将在南京农业大学园艺学院网站上公布并电话联系学生本人，未入选者不另行通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>五、日程安排</span></span> <span><span>（暂定）</span></span></p>\n<p><span>7</span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>日下午：营员现场报到</span>;</span></p>\n<p><span>7</span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>日上午：开营仪式，名家讲坛；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>7</span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>日下午：南京农业大学滨江校区参观；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>7</span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>日上午：科学家面对面</span>;</span></p>\n<p><span>7</span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>日下午：闭幕式</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>六、有关说明</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1.</span><span><span>学院为所有入营同学提供</span></span><span>7</span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span>-7</span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>日晚间住宿</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>市区和本校学生不安排</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>，以及</span></span><span>7</span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>日晚餐、</span></span><span>7</span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span>-</span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>日三餐餐券。学员请自行预定往返车票，费用自理，可保留相关车费票据</span></span><span><span>和付款记录</span></span><span><span>，待录取入学后可报销路费（限动车</span></span><span>/</span><span><span>高铁二等座、火车硬座</span></span><span>/</span><span><span>硬卧或长途汽车）。各位学员</span></span><span><span>自行购买</span><span>7月8-10日</span></span><span><span>旅途意外保险</span>;</span></p>\n<p><span>2.</span><span><span>参加暑期夏令营的学生在夏令营期间应遵守国家及地方法律法规、南京农业大学等的相关规定，遵循统一安排参加活动</span>;</span></p>\n<p><span>3.</span><span><span>未在规定时间内报到者视为自动放弃</span>;</span></p>\n<p><span>4.</span><span><span>一经发现申请者申报材料有弄虚作假内容，立即取消申请人资格，并保留追责的权利。</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span><span>南京农业大学园艺学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span>202</span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>19</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"c0e1525f0dbf7a5040b9b0c761a76c9519ed8e5b8a8f544e152a61e76bf3c1e8","textLength":1192,"sourceSha256":"821e5168bf16998f983d0de1f223ccd07505b7806ba894c6029cedd8dc99ee6e","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件2：线下参加安全责任书.docx","url":"https://yyxy.njau.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1344677414&wbfileid=15548056"},{"name":"附件1：报名表.docx","url":"https://yyxy.njau.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1344677414&wbfileid=15548055"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-bf15c5907d711afb0efc","title":"2025年南京农业大学园艺学院2025年全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营招募的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:55.543389+00:00"}
